        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Mammon Systems, Technician.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your first day as a Tier 1 Vending Machine Specialist begins now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vending Machine</strong> is a survival horror game where you must evade and escape from a hostile anomalous vending machine by locating and inserting coins into eight vending machines scattered throughout the containment zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vending Machine Horror:</strong> Dr. [REDACTED] initially described the entity as a “goofy-ahh vending unit,” but later retracted the statement after it sprinted at him full speed during an attempt to record “content for his chat,” as per his post-incident statement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Simulated Containment Zone: </strong>Our scientists and engineers have built a fake human city to contain these vending machines. Your job as a certified technician is to keep them satiated and satisfied by inserting coins into their slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalous Entities:</strong> Between the bloodthirsty beverage dispenser and a disfigured, screaming humanoid thingy, you’ll have more than just routine maintenance  to worry about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Gameplay: </strong>Turn off your flashlight. Listen closely. Use your spatial awareness to slip past hostile machines undetected in pitch darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on the Move:</strong> Keep moving and weaving between obstacles to throw off your pursuers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape: </strong>Once your objectives are complete, make a break for the exit. Do it fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Mammon Systems, Technician.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your first day as a Tier 1 Vending Machine Specialist begins now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vending Machine</strong> is a survival horror game where you must evade and escape from a hostile anomalous vending machine by locating and inserting coins into eight vending machines scattered throughout the containment zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vending Machine Horror:</strong> Dr. [REDACTED] initially described the entity as a “goofy-ahh vending unit,” but later retracted the statement after it sprinted at him full speed during an attempt to record “content for his chat,” as per his post-incident statement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Simulated Containment Zone: </strong>Our scientists and engineers have built a fake human city to contain these vending machines. Your job as a certified technician is to keep them satiated and satisfied by inserting coins into their slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalous Entities:</strong> Between the bloodthirsty beverage dispenser and a disfigured, screaming humanoid thingy, you’ll have more than just routine maintenance  to worry about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Gameplay: </strong>Turn off your flashlight. Listen closely. Use your spatial awareness to slip past hostile machines undetected in pitch darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on the Move:</strong> Keep moving and weaving between obstacles to throw off your pursuers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape: </strong>Once your objectives are complete, make a break for the exit. Do it fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
